{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GnmTqF81m9F8jjZ1cuczgW","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Insights from Negative Results NLP workshop review criteria rating scale scoring rubric\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Proceedings of the Fourth Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP - ACL Anthology\",\"url\":\"https://aclanthology.org/volumes/2023.insights-1/\"},{\"title\":\"The Third Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP | ACL Member Portal\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/third-workshop-insights-negative-results-nlp-0\"},{\"title\":\"Insights 2024 | Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP\",\"url\":\"https://insights-workshop.github.io/\"},{\"title\":\"INSIGHTS FROM NEGATIVE RESULTS IN NLP. WORKSHOP. 2ND 2022. (INSIGHTS 2022) - proceedings.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.proceedings.com/67716.html\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2013/PaperInformation/ReviewerInstructions\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP2020: Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP\",\"url\":\"https://virtual.2020.emnlp.org/workshop_WS-3.html\"},{\"title\":\"CFP | Insights 2024\",\"url\":\"https://insights-workshop.github.io/2021/cfp/\"},{\"title\":\"The Sixth Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP, pages 106–120\",\"url\":\"https://aclanthology.org/2025.insights-1.11.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results | ACL Member Portal\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/workshop-insights-negative-results\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found information about the \"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP\" but the search did not return specific details about review criteria, rating scales, or scoring rubrics used by this workshop.\n\nHere's what I found about the workshop:\n\nThe Workshop 