{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015mTbLVp47UoMng1YDtnjqf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 tax_error_inject_agent 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (61 个)\\n\\n- **v4-random-sft**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **v4-taxei-sft**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **mini-vanilla-sft-v4**: PREPARING (success) — \\n- **mini-random-sft-v3**: PREPARING (success) — \\n- **mini-taxei-sft-v3**: PREPARING (success) — \\n- **mini-vanilla-sft-v3**: PREPARING (success) — \\n- **v3-vanilla-eval**: PREPARING (success) — \\n- **v4-vanilla-sft**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **vanilla_sft_aligned_v2**: PREPARING — \\n- **vanilla_sft_aligned_v1**: PREPARING — \\n- **mini-vanilla-sft**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mini-taxei-sft**: DONE (success) — \\n- **vanilla-react-baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mini-pipeline-e2e**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **sft-dryrun-73**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- v4-fixed-inject25（准备中）\\n- v4-fixed-inject10（准备中）\\n- v4-recovery-eval-dev: Recovery eval pipeline development — inject errors during eval to test if TaxEI models recover better than random/vanilla (Option C from D009)（准备中）\\n- v4-recovery-dryrun: D010 Phase 2 前置: Recovery eval --inject 模式 dry-run, 1-2 tasks 验证 pipeline 正常工作（准备中）\\n- v4-random-eval: v4 Random SFT eval — formal Gate 3b judgment, same-source 9,029 samples, checkpoint-3387（准备中）\\n- v4-taxei-eval: v4 TaxEI SFT eval — formal Gate 3a/3b judgment, same-source 9,029 samples, checkpoint-3387（准备中）\\n- v4-vanilla-eval-r3: v4 Vanilla SFT eval r3 — dynamic checkpoint lookup with sort -V, adapter_config.json pre-check（准备中）\\n- v4-vanilla-eval-r2: v4 Vanilla SFT eval retry — fixed --device cuda:0 (was --gpu 0) + explicit checkpoint-1635（准备中）\\n- v4-random-sft-r2: v4 Random SFT retry (r2) — same-source 9,029 samples, formal Gate 3b. Previous run killed by SIGHUP.（准备中）\\n- v4-taxei-sft-r2: v4 TaxEI SFT retry (r2) — same-source 9,029 samples, formal Gate 3a/3b. Previous run killed by SIGHUP.（准备中）\\n- …另有 16 项\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **v4-random-fixed-inject50-eval** (success): v4 Random 50% injection fixed-size eval — 47 tasks clean eval. 与 TaxEI 50% (51.1%) 对比。Random dose-response 最后一点。\\n- **v4-random-fixed-inject25-eval** (success): v4 Random 25% injection fixed-size eval — 47 ALFWorld tasks (clean). 与 TaxEI 25% (48.9%) 对比。 ← 基于 v4-random-fixed-inject25\\n- **v4-random-fixed-inject25** (success): v4 Random fixed-size ablation: 25% injection (4,358 total). 与 TaxEI 25% (48.9%) 对比 taxonomy 标签在中等注入比例下是否有差异。\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 28 / 负向 5 / 失败 1 / 共 35\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n- v4-vanilla-seed7: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01R2j8yrXHw6d35UTJKxEpU2","session_id":"cac5a696-6b6e-48ad-ab92-08181aa0595a","uuid":"0d46899a-c0c0-4bcf-bf56-de02c478bd6f","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:57:16.895Z"}
