{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017oZfgTWiArETvweQdNqDse","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# tax_error_inject_agent — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 02:00 UTC | 更新原因: Random dose-response 完成，双效应模型确立（D017），Priority 1 实验全部齐备\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Negative result paper: \\\\\\\"Error Injection Helps Tool-Use but Hurts Planning — Boundary Conditions for Failure-Augmented Agent Training\\\\\\\"**\\\\n\\\\n三层核心发现：(1) 方差梯度 Vanilla(3.3)<Random(7.0)<TaxEI(8.6)；(2) dose-response 阈值-plateau（10%→25% 双方均掉 12.8pp）；(3) taxonomy 标签恒定惩罚（~6.4pp 跨所有 dose）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 阶段\\\\n**Negative Result Paper — 补充实验完成，准备写作**\\\\n\\\\n## 全维度结果汇总\\\\n\\\\n### Clean Eval（3-seed 全部完成）\\\\n| 方法 | seed=42 | seed=0 | seed=123 | 均值±SD |\\\\n|------|---------|--------|----------|---------|\\\\n| Vanilla | 61.7% | 68.1% | 66.0% | **65.3%±3.3pp** |\\\\n| TaxEI | 61.7% | 46.8% | 61.7% | **56.7%±8.6pp** |\\\\n| Random | 66.0% | 55.3% | 68.1% | **63.1%±7.0pp** |\\\\n\\\\n所有比较 NS：TaxEI vs Vanilla pooled p=0.054, TaxEI vs Random pooled p=0.170\\\\n\\\\n### Dose-Response 完整（fixed-size 4,358, seed=42）✅\\\\n| Dose | TaxEI | Random | Δ(R−T) |\\\\n|------|-------|--------|---------|\\\\n| 0% | 61.7% | 61.7% | 0 |\\\\n| 10% | 61.7% (0pp) | 68.1% (+6.4pp) | +6.4pp |\\\\n| 25% | 48.9% (-12.8pp) | 55.3% (-6.4pp) | +6.4pp |\\\\n| 50% | 51.1% (-10.6pp) | 57.4% (-4.3pp) | +6.3pp |\\\\n\\\\n**双效应模型**：共享阈值（10%→25% 双方均掉 12.8pp）+ taxonomy 恒定惩罚（~6.4pp）\\\\n\\\\n### Recovery Eval（seed=42, 47 tasks）\\\\n| 指标 | Vanilla | TaxEI | Random |\\\\n|------|---------|-------|--------|\\\\n| Recovery | 61.7% | 59.6% | **63.8%** |\\\\n| Detection | 0% | 0% | 0% |\\\\n\\\\n### Training Dynamics\\\\n注入越多 → 训练 loss 越低 / token acc 越高 → eval 越差（训练-评估悖论）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前 GPU 状态\\\\n| GPU | 状态 |\\\\n|-----|------|\\\\n| cuda:0-3 | 全部空闲 — dose-response 完成 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] TaxEI dose-response 完成 (10%/25%/50%)\\\\n- [x] Random dose-response 完成 (10%/25%/50%)\\\\n- [x] 3-seed 全方法完成\\\\n- [x] multiseed_stats.py 修复 + seed=123\\\\n- [ ] experiment_plan.yaml 补全（Reviewer warning）\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate 评估投稿可行性\\\\n- [ ] **启动论文写作**（Priority 1 实验全部齐备）\\\\n- [ ] registry 更新（inject25/50 eval 标 DONE）\\\\n- [ ] 文献引用验证（dose-response survey 中 3 个可疑引用）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nautodl-5090 cuda:0-3，当前 0/4 在用。所有 Priority 1 实验完成。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键观察\\\\n- **双效应模型是最强 finding**：共享阈值 + 恒定 taxonomy 惩罚，跨 3 个 dose 点一致\\\\n- 方差梯度：Vanilla < Random < TaxEI — 结构化注入放大不稳定性\\\\n- 训练-评估悖论：注入降低 loss 但损害泛化\\\\n- 所有均值比较 NS（最小 p=0.054）\\\\n- Random 10% 的 68.1% 在 vanilla 种子方差范围内，不应声称\\\\\\\"数据增强效应\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Target: Insights from Negative Results @ EMNLP 2026\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-15 | D016 扩展：完整 dose-response 揭示两个可分离效应——(1) 注入剂量阈值（10% | v4-random-fixed-inject10-eval, v4-random-fixed-inject25-eval, v4-random-fixed-inject50-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-eval |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-15 | D015 再修正：pooled permutation test 修复后 TaxEI vs Vani | v4-taxei-seed123-eval, v4-random-seed123-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-eval |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-14 | D012 修正：3-seed TaxEI 均值 56.7%（非 54.3%），p>0.3 不显著。叙 | v4-taxei-seed123-eval |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-14 | D010 终止条件正式触发：TaxEI recovery ≤ Random，项目转 negative | v4-random-recovery-eval, v4-taxei-recovery-eval, v4-vanilla-recovery-eval |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-14 | D010 Phase 2 recovery eval 确认 TaxEI 无价值：recovery 5 | v4-taxei-recovery-eval, v4-vanilla-recovery-eval |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-14 | D010 Phase 1 多种子验证结论：注入训练系统性损害 clean performance，T | v4-vanilla-seed0-eval, v4-vanilla-seed123-eval, v4-taxei-seed0-eval, v4-random-seed0-eval |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-14 | D010 补充：Recovery eval 统计检验由 Fisher exact 改为 McNema | — |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-14 | 修正 D009：D008 FAIL 不可撤回。Recovery eval 是补充分析（非替代原 Ga | mini-vanilla-sft-v4 |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-14 | 选 Option C: Recovery-Specific Evaluation + 多种子验证。C | mini-taxei-sft-v4, mini-random-sft-v4 |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-14 | v4 Gate 判定：Gate 3a FAIL（TaxEI=Vanilla 61.7%），Gate  | mini-vanilla-sft-v4, mini-taxei-sft-v4, mini-random-sft-v4 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3726, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015BqvYLGM2APFWL1zScnxBt","session_id":"cac5a696-6b6e-48ad-ab92-08181aa0595a","uuid":"61632461-666f-4090-bfd8-3c04870abf09","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:57:58.626Z"}
