{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013SkvYZXzCBWbq4evkwjQke","type":"tool_result","content":"96\t\\begin{table}[t]\n97\t\\centering\n98\t\\small\n99\t\\begin{tabular}{lcccccc}\n100\t\\toprule\n101\t\\textbf{Method} & \\textbf{S42} & \\textbf{S0} & \\textbf{S123} & \\textbf{Mean} & \\textbf{SD} \\\\\n102\t\\midrule\n103\tVanilla & 61.7 & 68.1 & 66.0 & 65.3 & 3.3 \\\\\n104\tRandom  & 68.1 & 74.5 & 70.2 & 70.9 & 3.3 \\\\\n105\tTaxEI   & 61.7 & 68.1 & 63.8 & 64.5 & 3.3 \\\\\n106\t\\bottomrule\n107\t\\end{tabular}\n108\t\\caption{Clean task success rate (\\%) on ALFWorld 47 test tasks across three seeds.}\n109\t\\label{tab:core}\n110\t\\end{table}\n111\t\n112\tThe variance gradient---Vanilla SD (3.3pp) $<$ Random SD (7.0pp) $<$ TaxEI SD (8.6pp)---holds across all seeds, indicating that more structured injection amplifies training instability.\n113\t\n114\t\\subsection{Dose-Response Curve}\n115\t\\label{sec:dose}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015BqvYLGM2APFWL1zScnxBt","session_id":"cac5a696-6b6e-48ad-ab92-08181aa0595a","uuid":"c2416895-de78-4b8a-80ca-49fabd01e19f","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:58:17.860Z"}
