{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AcYLgCucSrS9iEfaZRRBUJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review submitted successfully.\n\n**Summary**: Two-reviewer roundtable completed for dream_20260515T020837. Both reviewers converged on **Soundness 3, Excitement 3, Overall 3** → **Borderline Accept**. The paper has a clean core experimental design and reports a genuine, informative negative result. Key strengths: per-operator locality gradient, qualitative error echoes, honest hierarchical claims. Key issues requiring revision: overclaimed \"constant taxonomy penalty\" (discretization artifact), missing formal variance tests for the primary finding, thin related work (especially missing Reflexion), unaddressed recovery-pairing confound with PALADIN, and paper length 2× over venue limit. Report written to `dream_reports/dream_20260515T020837/median/review_report.md`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4429,"cache_read_input_tokens":80401,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4429},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cac5a696-6b6e-48ad-ab92-08181aa0595a","uuid":"dde850ad-ffec-49e2-a653-07b1c127d7ff"}
